  <item>
    <title>【063】七个月不见，生活继续，人生系统一直自动更新</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3b1f269b6a485e8c7cba4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3b1f269b6a485e8c7cba4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 06:47:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活总比我们预料的给我们更多，无论是疾病的敲门，新生命的到来，还是变化的生活，重启的人生阶段。这就是传说中的计划赶不上变化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当它到来时，当时的我们觉得是难以跨越的大山。但几个月之后再回首，自己竟然穿越过来了。为自己点个赞吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活在碎石泥瓦之上，祝你首先要快乐，其次，都是其次。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 断更7个月刚好孕育了一个新生命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 即将成为期待中的“空巢老人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 工作城市关系都重启一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> 生病手术带来的动荡与变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 孕早期的至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a> 手术前后的各种害怕恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a> 自我存在感的危机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 正在经历身心整合的阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> 长时间没有拿到正反馈令人挫败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> 人逃不掉“这一生为何而来”的功课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">63:34</a> 不想重启，修修补补就好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">64:32</a> 并不是换一种活法才是重启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4614">76:54</a> 祝我们所有人都可以都快乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loZUuRmSbXBlp9rji0cLJy5PA1KD.m4a" length="112510893" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBoPlsoT9S1oedH06JmjhFlXkXy.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【062】明明才刚开年，为什么却感觉这么累？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c1c5960847349e0cffa742</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c1c5960847349e0cffa742</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 05:37:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年是个有仪式感的开始，在这个起点上我们似乎都应该有点“而今迈步从头越”的劲头才对，但身边很多朋友的感受却是——“心力交瘁”。今天几位处于不同生活和精神状态的主播聚在一起聊聊，为什么我们在开年没有体验到任何兴奋感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a> 目标屡次难以达到的无力感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 对比起来有螺旋式上升的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 变化带来兴奋感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 疲惫背后的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 积极的自我暗示，哪怕是盲目乐观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 身心一体，相互影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 疲惫感是一个共性的问题吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 大环境无法掌控，过好每个小日常</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltBcNxVd41ggQUzcoPM811SrWg44.m4a" length="82695005" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoQm9QbHNvVDlTMW9lZEgwNkptamhGbFhrWHkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
