  <item>
    <title>【061】当陈朗小姐成为妻子，“不被率”的勇气与自由</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b74be31ed6d5797f4a2cc6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b74be31ed6d5797f4a2cc6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在我们的文化传统中，为逝者一生的成就与贡献致意是悼文不变的主旋律，而陈朗女士却在悼念亡夫的文章中展开了自己与丈夫权力关系的社会学思考，淋漓尽致的真实让很多人为之触动。几位主播围绕着悼文《请君重作醉歌行》展开了讨论，真诚地祝愿每一位女性都有“不被率”的勇气与自由。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> &nbsp;真实和勇气值得敬佩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> &nbsp;《致吾女》中明亮自由的陈朗小姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> &nbsp;现实的沉默与内心的尖叫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> &nbsp;通过剥削母亲来完成社会和家庭赋予自己的责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> &nbsp;期待放在自己or别人身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> &nbsp;女性对家庭克制不住的付出欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> &nbsp;没必要把自己的头脑交给他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> &nbsp;文章激起的涟漪很有意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> &nbsp;祝福陈朗和女儿一切都好</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqg7iHANEca9rnmkM-NJZN_Ava9-.m4a" length="62738009" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoQm9QbHNvVDlTMW9lZEgwNkptamhGbFhrWHkucG5n.png"/>
