  <item>
    <title>【055】来自全世界的喜欢，也抵不过我对自己的讨厌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64eb57fde490c5dee5967ef8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64eb57fde490c5dee5967ef8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 2023 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Cheri Huber在《不是你的错》里写道：“如果你在生活中遇到一个人，像你对待自己一样对待你，你早就离开Ta了。”我们的内心深处仿佛存在着一个尖锐、苛刻的批评者，不断地向自己提出切中要害的质疑、贬低，甚至是羞辱。今天几位主播聚在一起聊聊，从厌己到悦己究竟要经历多少的千沟万壑。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指北】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 20多岁时自我厌恶达到顶峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 厌己带来的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 在悦己和厌己之间反复横跳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> 你是你自己最重要的宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 打过硬仗内心会涌现出对自己的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 真的爱自己时不需要别人爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 价值观不鼓励多元是厌己的重要原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 从厌己到悦己，走了十年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 意识到自己还挺棒的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 不是去解决问题而是去探寻奥秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 天大的事睡一觉就过去了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llpGiAasUZ6RrdlwSYh8EdikWof1.m4a" length="82522706" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqUDYzUm0yLWk0S0ZOYzl1MFlnSVlYX2JNaFgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
